# Retched Wretch, {2}{B} 4/2: "When this creature dies, if it had a -1/-1 counter on it, return it to the battlefield under
# its owner's control and it loses all abilities." (CR 603.4, 603.10a, 400.7). Blight Rot puts four -1/-1 counters on it: it
# dies as a -4/-2... and returns as a new 4/2 with no counters. A second Blight Rot kills it again, and as it lost its ability
# it stays in the graveyard (had the ability stayed, it would return a second time). Black Lotus pays the first Blight Rot
